  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord 服务器\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fquillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/View on-GitHub-181717?logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上查看\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner?style=social\" alt=\"为这个仓库点赞\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p><p><strong>矿脉矿工</strong></p><p>当你**潜行**时用镐子破坏一个矿石，它会自动挖掘相连的矿石方块。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xl2GihRU/images/64ad1935bc25e006be50ed8fa4d9697da2639985.gif\" alt=\"矿脉挖掘示例1\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xl2GihRU/images/1e1388588ccb36007b8137ce4584200f31626d17.gif\" alt=\"矿脉挖掘示例2\"></p><hr><h3>工作原理</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>潜行</strong>并用<strong>镐子</strong>挖掘任意<strong>矿石方块</strong>。整个<strong>相连的矿脉</strong>将自动被挖掘（兼容精准采集）</li>\n</ul><hr><h3>注意事项</h3><p><strong>检测到时运附魔时将自动禁用矿脉挖掘</strong></p>",
